Force jQuery in Head plugin add jQuery in top of the head in the site.

== Description ==

This Simple plugin helps you to add the jQuery in top of the head in the theme.

How does it work?

1. Install the plugin
2. And Activate it, after that it will work automatically.

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/force-jquery-in-head` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. After that it will work Automatically

